<div class="container section-space">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Metrics and Models</p><h1>Good questions.<br><i>Open minds.</i></h1><p>A community of health and social data scientists at the University of Oxford, in conversation with the world.</p></header>
  <section class="editorial-section"><p class="eyebrow">What brings us together</p><div class="prose"><h2>Data is a starting point.</h2><p>Our work spans health and social data science: how we measure the world, how we model it, and what we can learn along the way. The seminar series brings new research and a broad range of perspectives into the same conversation.</p><p>Our organising team brings together people from Oxford's Demographic Science Unit, Engineering Science, Oxford Internet Institute, and Sociology.</p><a class="text-link" href="/people/">Meet the team {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section" id="join"><p class="eyebrow">Take part</p><div class="prose"><h2>Come along.</h2><p>We meet online every other Thursday at 14:00 UK time, following GMT or BST with the seasons. Everyone is welcome, from academia, industry, the public sector, and beyond.</p><p>Subscribe to the seminar mailing list for invitations and joining information, or register using the form.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="button" href="{{ site.subscribe }}">Subscribe by email {% icon "mail" %}</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.registration }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div><p class="small muted">Oxford colleagues can also <a href="https://web.maillist.ox.ac.uk/ox/info/metrics_and_models" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe through the mailing-list service</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section"><p class="eyebrow">Share your work</p><div class="prose"><h2>Bring a new perspective.</h2><p>We welcome ideas for future seminars across health and social data science.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://forms.office.com/e/KsFZYcMz5C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Propose a talk {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section"><p class="eyebrow">Closer to home</p><div class="prose"><h2>The local lab.</h2><p>In the off-weeks, our Oxford group meets for informal presentations, feedback, and collaboration. Internal sessions are for members of the local mailing list.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="/details/internal_lab_sessions.html">Lab sessions {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Get in touch {% icon "mail" %}</a></div></div></section>
